Package: sylvester
Type: Package
Title: Solve Sylvester Matrix Equations via 'RcppArmadillo'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Christopher", "Grieves", email = "cyg5005@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Solves the Sylvester matrix equation A X + X B = Q for real or
    complex matrices, mirroring the 'SciPy' function
    'scipy.linalg.solve_sylvester'. The real case dispatches to the
    'Armadillo' 'LAPACK'-backed solver (the same 'dtrsyl' routine 'SciPy'
    uses); the complex case uses a Bartels-Stewart implementation (Schur
    decomposition plus triangular back-substitution).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
